406. Does user = new User(...) replace the caller's object?


407. Does user.name = ... affect the caller?


408. Does final User user make the object immutable?



Design

409. Design APIs minimizing accidental mutation.


410. Decide when to return a new object.


411. Decide when defensive copying is required.


412. Decide when immutable state is preferable.



Debugging Challenges

413. Debug primitive reassignment.


414. Debug object mutation.


415. Debug reference reassignment.


416. Debug aliasing.


417. Draw the caller/parameter/object diagram.



Production

