538. Should every class be immutable?


539. Should every dependency have an interface?


540. Should every duplicate piece of code be extracted?


541. Should every inheritance hierarchy be replaced?


542. Should every future requirement get an abstraction?


543. Should every performance concern be optimized?



Design

544. Design a production payment abstraction.


545. Design immutable domain objects.


546. Design a cohesive order domain.


547. Design extension points without overengineering.


548. Decide where composition belongs.



Debugging Challenges

