550. Diagnose a HashMap production failure.


551. Diagnose unexpected polymorphic dispatch.


552. Diagnose constructor-order behavior.


553. Diagnose reference/aliasing problems.



Production

554. Refactor a God class using SOLID without overengineering.


555. Design a payment abstraction supporting new providers.


556. Explain when not to use inheritance.


557. Explain when DRY should not be applied.


558. Balance OCP against YAGNI.


559. Diagnose a production equality bug.


560. Explain object references and memory retention.


561. Design immutable domain objects for concurrent services.



These are explicitly part of the source's senior/production challenge set. 


