🔥 1.9 — Final Integrated Challenge

After all individual exercises, build one complete production-style Order Processing System:

Order System
                              │
        ┌─────────────────────┼─────────────────────┐
        ↓                     ↓                     ↓
     Order                 Customer              Money
        │
        ├── OrderId
        ├── OrderItem
        └── OrderStatus
                  │
                  ↓
          PaymentProcessor
          ├── Card
          ├── UPI
          └── Bank Transfer

It should demonstrate:

Core Java

constructors

this()

super()

initialization order

access modifiers

final

static


OOP

inheritance

interfaces

abstraction

overloading

overriding

runtime polymorphism

dynamic dispatch


Object Model

Object

equals()

