identity

mutable-key behavior


Design

SRP

OCP

LSP

ISP

DIP

composition

coupling

cohesion

DRY

KISS

YAGNI

Law of Demeter

Tell Don't Ask


Debugging

Intentionally introduce:

❌ broken equals()
❌ missing hashCode()
❌ mutable HashMap key
❌ wrong constructor order
❌ polymorphism bug
❌ pass-by-value misconception
❌ aliasing bug
❌ null handling bug

Then diagnose and fix every one.

Performance

Measure rather than guess:

Mutable vs immutable
Varargs vs array
Interface dispatch
Virtual dispatch
Final method
Static method
Allocation
GC

Use JMH/profiling where appropriate rather than relying on naïve microbenchmarks. 


